REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_DHCR24 — DHCR24 24-dehydrocholesterol reductase (DHCR24/Diminuto) after DHCR7 on sterol continuum
# Continuum ...->pcca->mcee->mut->suclg1->sdha->fh->mdh->cs->aco2->idh2->ogdh->scs->dld->dlst->oxct1->acat1->hmgcs2->hmgcl->bdh1->slc16a1->slc16a7->emb->aacs->hmgcs1->hmgcr->mvk->pmvk->mvd->idi1->fdps->sqs->sqle->lss->cyp51->tm7sf2->sc4mol->nsdhl->hsd17b7->ebp->sc5d->dhcr7->dhcr24 (DHCR24 after DHCR7)
# Gift: DHCR24 saturates Delta24 sterol sealing Bloch+KR cholesterol under ASSERT after DHCR7 open.
# Domain: post-DHCR7 24-dehydrocholesterol reductase (DHCR24/Diminuto) cholesterol-ward Bloch seal.
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

